Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(136.8,59.733)}I love apples! Kikkun, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}*Nom, nom, nom*{\i0} \NAh, delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.03,0:00:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Apples really are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, you really love apples, tsun, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, I love 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd take apples over three square \Nmeals any day- Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wouldn't you prefer three square meals after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehhhhh....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, \NI want to eat rice and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it'd be great if we could have an apple as dessert \Nwith every single meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Comparing apples to regular meals is just silly, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs40\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(195.2,73.6)}{\pos(186.4,81.067)}A few minutes later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's down to the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They were so good I just kept eating them, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsun-tsun, you can go ahead and eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the last one. \NYou can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The very last apple that Daddy bought and peeled. \Nyou can eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.55,0:00:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Because as a father, \NI want my beloved child to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy is always so kind and wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,, but whenever apples are involved, he always gets so possessive, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.97,0:01:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! If things are going to be like this, \NI'll just get rid of the very concept of apples!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs37\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(196,233.6)}{\pos(186.4,81.067)\c&HE1CB6F&}Concept Eradicator R
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.89,0:01:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}Concept Eradicator!{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I drank the Concept Eradicator, so the concept of apples should be completely gone now, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.50,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s this? Is it something I can eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}*Nom, nom, nom*{\i0} 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. \NThat’s just how Daddy is, isn’t it, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is delicious! What is this? \NDid you invent this, Tsun-tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, \Nthis would definitely be amazing as a juice or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The aftertaste is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got a bit of tanginess to it, right? \NMan, I'm blown away!
